# 4. BVA – Number of Tickets in BookMyShow

**Requirement:** Number of tickets allowed = **1 to 10**.

The important boundary values are around **1 and 10**.

| Test Case ID | Number of Tickets | Expected Result |
| ------------ | ----------------: | --------------- |
| **TC-T01**   |                 0 | ❌ Rejected      |
| **TC-T02**   |                 1 | ✅ Accepted      |
| **TC-T03**   |                 2 | ✅ Accepted      |
| **TC-T04**   |                 9 | ✅ Accepted      |
| **TC-T05**   |                10 | ✅ Accepted      |
| **TC-T06**   |                11 | ❌ Rejected      |

### Explanation

The valid range is **1–10**. Therefore, the values just outside the range (**0 and 11**) should fail, while the boundary values (**1 and 10**) should work correctly.

